  Notation ST4 pc mm n x5 x6 x7 x28 x29 :=
    (MS (mkR x1 sp gp tp x5 x6 x7 (Z_to_bv 64 WK) x9 x10 x11 (Z_to_bv 64 SY) (Z_to_bv 64 (nbS - 3)) (Z_to_bv 64 RS)
